From a1ca246af56bc866c1126cc619aaa053ec041e1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hank Yeomans <hank@quorra.ah.local>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 19:29:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02/61] engram: file layout (A-min) -- table stays in the
 checkpoint shard

SGLANG_DSV41_ENGRAM_HOST_TABLE_LAYOUT=file maps the shard read-only and views
the rank's row range; no host copy, no pinning, page cache is the row cache.
Lookup is a CPU gather behind MADV_WILLNEED from a thread pool, run as an
eager_on_graph break (decode needs --cuda-graph-backend-decode breakable).
Bit-exact vs safetensors; ~1 ms/layer cold at T=1, ~0.5 s per 4K prefill chunk.

Amp-Thread-ID: https://ampcode.com/threads/T-01a0c10b-a5f8-77fc-b238-7147d12ccf29
Co-authored-by: Amp <amp@ampcode.com>
